{
    "title": "Scores App: College Football",
    "description": "Are you tired of cluttered sports apps that leave you guessing about the latest college football scores and game stats? Look no further! Our NCAA Scores App delivers lightning-fast updates including real-time alerts & play-by-play, ensuring you never miss a moment of the action.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd25 Live college football scores and real-time plays to keep you in the action.\r\n\ud83d\ude80 Lightning-fast updates, including full play-by-play and stats.\r\n\ud83d\udce2 Immediate game notifications for scores, close games, overtime, and more!\r\n\ud83c\udfc8 Up-to-the-minute team & player boxscore stats.\r\n\ud83d\udcca View the AP top 25 and college football playoff (CFP) rankings.\r\n\ud83d\udcfa Game previews: matchup stats, TV channels, weather, and more!\r\n\ud83d\udcb0 Game odds including first & second half lines. Point spread, money line, and over-under.\r\n\ud83d\udcb2 Betting trends and previous game results for each line scope & line type.\r\n\ud83d\udcc5 Customize your schedule: filter by team, conference, rankings, and more.\r\n\ud83d\udcc8 Player & Team Season Stats: Explore league leaders in passing, rushing, receiving, sacks, and more.\r\n\ud83c\udfc6 Stay updated with team standings by conference.\r\n\u23f0 Never Miss a Game: Set reminders to tune in.\r\n\ud83d\udcf0 Access college football news on the go.\r\n\ud83c\udf10 No internet connection? No problem! Full schedule is available offline.\r\n\ud83d\udd04 Easily check scores from past college football games.\r\n\ud83d\udcc6 Includes the 2023 FBS & FCS (Division 1) college football schedule, with bowl games automatically added.\r\n\r\nNCAA Bowl games will be added as scheduled, including Rose Bowl, Sugar Bowl, Peach Bowl, Fiesta Bowl, & the title game. Who will reach the FBS title game: Alabama Crimson Tide, Clemson Tigers, UT, Georgia Bulldogs, or Oklahoma Sooners?\r\n\r\nScores App Privacy Policy:\r\nhttps://www.scoresapp.com/privacy\r\n\r\n** Please note: This app is not endorsed by or affiliated with the National Collegiate Athletic Association. Any trademarks used in the app are done so under \"fair use\" with the sole purpose of identifying the respective entities, and remain the property of their respective owners.",
